/photos/williston-store.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/williston-store-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/williston-store.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="739" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M9 6h2M13 6h2M9 10h2M13 10h2M9 14h2M13 14h2M10 22v-4h4v4"/></svg>03</span><h2 class="card-h">Commercial, HOA &amp; Multifamily Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal and estimating for disputed claims on commercial buildings, associations, apartment complexes and mixed-use properties.</p></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-representation/hail-roof-siding-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/home-c.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/home-c-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/home-c.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="795" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 16.6A5 5 0 0 0 18 7h-1.3A8 8 0 1 0 4 15.3"/><path d="M8 19v1M8 14v1M16 19v1M16 14v1M12 21v1M12 16v1"/></svg>04</span><h2 class="card-h">Hail, Roof &amp; Siding Appraisal</h2><p>Line-by-line valuation of hail damage to roofs, siding, gutters, windows and soft metals across North Dakota.</p></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-representation/wind-derecho-tornado-appraisal/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage2.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage2-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/p