n class="card-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 21V10l9-6 9 6v11z"/><path d="M9 21v-6h6v6M9 15l6 6M15 15l-6 6M12 4v3"/></svg>09</span><h2 class="card-h">Farm &amp; Ranch Building Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal of disputed claims on pole barns, Quonsets, steel buildings, shops, machine sheds and older barns.</p></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-representation/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-work.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-work-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-work.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg>10</span><h2 class="card-h">Carrier Estimate Review</h2><p>An independent line-by-line review of your carrier’s estimate, showing what may be missing, underpriced or misapplied.</p></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-representation/umpire-neutral-services/"><span class="card-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/handshake.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/handshake-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/handshake.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="799" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="card-b"><span class="card-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3v18M7 21h10M5 7h14M5 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0zM19 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0z"/></svg>11</span><h2 class="card-h">Umpire &amp; Neutral Appraiser Services</h2><p>Impartial umpire and neutral appraiser services for property insurance appraisals anywhere in North Dakota.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap two top"><div class="rv"><p class="label"><span>?</span>Where to start</p><h2>Most claims start with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone invokes appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and some disputes close right there.</p><a class="btn btn-navy" href="/appraisal-representation/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for one part of the process?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate review and decide later whether to invoke appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and farm claims?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — houses, condos, apartments, HOAs, retail, offices, churches, shops, pole barns and other farm or ranch buildings.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is it only hail?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. Wind, water, fire, freeze, ice-dam and snow-load losses all come through appraisal when the dispute is about cost.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in rv"><div><h2>Have a claim that doesn’t add up?</h2><p>Send us the carrier’s estimate. We’ll review it and tell you plainly what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-navy" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ink-line" href="/request-an-appraisal/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
